<header><p class="enc-kicker">Person</p><h1 class="enc-title">Septimius Severus</h1></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Septimius Severus was Roman emperor from 193 to 211 CE, born in <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/leptis-magna">Leptis Magna</a> in <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/north-africa">North Africa</a>. He mounted a campaign against the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/garamantian-empire">Garamantes</a> in 202 CE. He established Roman monitoring posts far to the south of the formal frontier.</p><figure class="enc-fig"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/septimius-severus.jpg" alt="Septimius Severus" width="291" height="420" fetchpriority="high"><figcaption>Image: Unknown artist · CC BY 2.0 · <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Septimius_Severus_busto-Musei_Capitolini.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wikimedia Commons</a></figcaption></figure></div>
